# Regression-test artifacts: SCF checkpoints and UV-vis spectra are
# produced by the test runs themselves and should not be committed.
# Already-tracked baseline checkpoints (e.g. water_rhf_pcm_water_sto3g.hfchk)
# are unaffected because git skips ignore-rules for tracked files.
